5. Her father owned classic PC games like Doom, Monkey Island 1 and 2, and Lemmings, which she has nostalgic memories of. (Verbatim: "Papa Elia has PC games on floppy disks... it had Doom and then, uh, Monkey Island 1 and 2, and there was Lemmings.")

