1. She has a childhood memory of trying to prank her older brother by writing on the wall and falsely blaming him, but was caught because her handwriting was too legible. (Verbatim: "Super little Elia decided to be a menace one day and wanted to frame her older brother... the handwriting is too legible. and i was like oh onyo onyo onyo.")

2. She once worked at a zoo, where she learned not to feed bananas to monkeys because human-bred fruit is too sweet and fattening for them. (Verbatim: "i was working at the zoo basically it was very very bad to give them um fruit... they're actually really fattening the monkeys so that's that monkey is more like fast food for them.")

3. She dislikes needles and has had difficult experiences with blood tests due to nurses struggling to find her veins. (Verbatim: "i go for tests the nurse is really bad with her needle aim... stabby stab stab and i'm like this is like turning up.")

4. She has a fear of being ignored or forgotten in group chats, which causes her anxiety about rejoining conversations after being silent. (Verbatim: "you're like oh gosh if i write anything now they're gonna be like i didn't know you were in this trap... what if i write something and then they just ignore it.")

5. She enjoys pranks and being a "menace," but claims she could never truly be one after her failed childhood prank. (Verbatim: "i could never be a menace. i could never be a menace. no no no i could never ever be a menace.")

6. She emphasizes creating a welcoming and non-intimidating environment for her chat, wanting no one to feel excluded or pressured. (Verbatim: "the last thing i want to be is intimidating... it's not supposed to be any sort of like i don't know um i don't want it to feel like a circle or a clique that you can't get in.")

7. She corrects people on the pronunciation of "herb," insisting it is pronounced with an "h" sound, not silent. (Verbatim: "Herb is with a H. Herb, okay? As in herbivores.")

8. She has a habit of selecting clips from her streams for editing, indicating involvement in post-production decisions. (Verbatim: "when i basically have my editor's clip i choose i'm the one choosing the moments.")

9. She expresses affection for bananas, often referencing them humorously and noting others’ fascination with them. (Verbatim: "Just kidding bananas bigger than you all actually you're all very small.")

10. She refers to her audience as "green," suggesting a community identity or inside term for her viewers. (Verbatim: "especially with y'all being so green... they will just greenify you.") [end of text]



